docs {
  PUT /pre-consultation/session/patient_category/
  
  Moderate / Borderline — Priya Sharma (34F Mumbai). Cardiometabolic + PCOS; cluster probe likely (65–80).
  
  Deselected categories delete orphan concerns immediately (FK cascade).
  
  Returns 409 when session completed.
  Reference: docs/pre_consultation/api-pre-consultation.md
